(The Direct Download Playbook) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
0 -30 Td
18 TL
(FlexibleFlix field guide - edition 2.4) Tj
() Tj
(1. Never gate a download behind a timer.) Tj
(   A countdown is a tax on trust. Ship the file immediately.) Tj
() Tj
(2. Keep the download on the same origin.) Tj
(   Same-origin links cannot be swapped for a redirect after the fact,) Tj
(   and the browser's own download manager handles the transfer.) Tj
() Tj
(3. Reserve every ad slot before the network loads it.) Tj
(   Fixed heights mean no layout shift and no chance of an overlay) Tj
(   landing on top of the download button.) Tj
() Tj
(4. Label sponsored placements plainly.) Tj
(   A muted 'Sponsored' label beats a box that impersonates a button.) Tj
() Tj
(5. Show size, version and date before the click.) Tj
(   Visitors should never be surprised by what they are saving.) Tj
() Tj
(6. No pop-ups, pop-unders or interstitials. Ever.) Tj
(   None of them convert better than a download that just works.) Tj
() Tj
(flexibleflix.example - direct downloads, zero detours) Tj
ET
